msgid "The directions are relative to the current orientation of Tux."
msgstr "Anvisningarna är relativa i förhållande till hur Tux står."

#. from kde:gcompris-gcompris_qt
msgid "This means that UP moves forward, DOWN moves backward, LEFT moves to the left side of Tux and RIGHT moves to the right side of Tux."
