msgid "Harry wants to share 8 pieces of candy between 3 of his friends: 1 boy and 2 girls. The boy already has one piece of candy. Can he split the pieces of candy so that they all have the same amount?"
msgstr "Hans vill dela åtta godisbitar lika mellan tre av sina vänner, en pojke och två flickor. Pojken har redan en godisbit. Kan han dela godisbitarna så att alla har lika många?"

