#. from kde:ksirk-ksirkskineditor
msgid "<p>Infantry number of individual frames.</p><p>The pool <i>infantry</i> element will be rendered on a pixmap of width: (<i>Width</i> * <i>Number of frames</i>) and then split into individual frames.</p>"
msgstr "<p>Antal enskilda bilder för infanteriet.</p><p>Poolens element <i>infantry</i> återges på en bildpunktsavbildning med bredden: (<i>Bredd</i> * <i>Antal versioner</i>), och delas därefter i enskilda bilder.</p>"

#. from kde:ksirk-ksirkskineditor
msgid "Number of infantry versions"
msgstr "Antal versioner av infanteri"

#. from kde:ksirk-ksirkskineditor
msgid "<p>Number of infantry versions.</p><p>The pool <i>infantry</i> element will be rendered on a pixmap of height: (<i>Height</i> * <i>Number of versions</i>) and then split into individual frames.</p><p>Each version shows the sprite visible from one direction: the first one is directed towards the right, the second towards the left, the third one from front and the last one from the back. However, not all sprites need all versions.</p>"
