#. from kde:kphotoalbum-kphotoalbum
msgid "<p><b>Delete Your Temporary Demo Database</b></p><p>I hope you enjoyed the KPhotoAlbum demo. The demo database was created in the folder <tt>/tmp</tt>, should it be deleted now? If you do not delete it, it will waste disk space; on the other hand, if you want to come back and try the demo again, you might want to keep it around with the changes you made through this session.</p>"
msgstr "<p><b>Ta bort den tillfälliga demonstrationsdatabasen</b></p><p>Jag hoppas att du tyckte om demonstrationen av Kfotoalbum. Demonstrationsdatabasen skapades i katalogen <tt>/tmp</tt>. Ska den nu tas bort? Om du inte tar bort den, slösar den diskutrymme. Å andra sidan, om du vill komma tillbaka och prova demonstrationen igen, kan du vilja behålla den med de ändringar du gjort i denna session.</p>"

