#. from kde:kphotoalbum-kphotoalbum
msgid "<p>KPhotoAlbum hit an internal error (missing plug-in menu in MainWindow::Window::setupPluginMenu). This indicate that you forgot to do a make install. If you did compile KPhotoAlbum yourself, then please run make install. If not, please report this as a bug.</p><p>KPhotoAlbum will continue execution, but it is not entirely unlikely that it will crash later on due to the missing make install.</p>"
