msgid "This will prevent <application>KAlarm</application> from functioning<nl/>except if you manually start it."
msgstr "Det förhindrar att <application>Kalarm</application> fungerar<nl/>förutom om det startas manuellt."

#. from kde:kalarm-kalarm
